          "note": {
            "en": "The fork retains the ns-3 Internet-stack models. Install and configure these stack components in the EasiEI scenario.",
            "zh": "该分支保留 ns-3 Internet 协议栈模型，可在 EasiEI 场景中安装并配置相应组件。"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "routing",
          "values": [
            "AODV",
            "OLSR",
            "DSDV",
            "DSR",
            "RIP",
            "RIPng",
            "Static routing",
            "Global routing"
          ],
          "scope": "packet",
          "source": "inherit:easiei:src/internet/doc/routing-overview.rst",
          "note": {
            "en": "Inherited routing implementations can be selected in the scenario. Global routing computes routes without OSPF packet exchange.",
            "zh": "可在场景中选用继承的路由实现；全局路由计算不产生 OSPF 协议报文。"
          }
        },
        {
