          "note": {
            "en": "The fork documents a/b/g/n/ac/ax PHY models, EDCA and mesh. Select the desired WifiNetDevice and PHY/MAC configuration; this fork does not document the newer 802.11be model.",
            "zh": "该分支记载 a/b/g/n/ac/ax PHY、EDCA 与 Mesh，可选择 WifiNetDevice 及 PHY/MAC 配置；该分支文档未包含较新的 802.11be 模型。"
          }
        },
        {
